-turn precedes coordinator containment cleanup. Controller contents are sealed
+turn precedes coordinator containment cleanup.
+The binary bundles `hermit-test-bin` from the current fbsource Hermit target and
+resolves packaged resources only when an execution is requested. It records that
+binary's path, bytes, imported upstream revision, and comparison with the
+versioned qualification probe in `hermit-import-compatibility.v1.json`. A
+qualified binary is copied to a mode-0500 artifact-local runtime before use. The
+current `a919cce` import is not compatible with the preserved `4630ee2a`
+witness, so execution fails before launch with the explicit compatibility state
+and blockers instead of silently substituting it.
+
+Controller contents are sealed
