+# ---------------------------------------------------------------- (1)(2) killability
+# The container init is a namespace PID 1 with no SIGTERM handler and the kernel
+# DISCARDS default-disposition signals to it, so `timeout` and even
+# `timeout --kill-after` cannot reap this process shape. A cgroup kill can.
+# RuntimeMaxSec on a transient unit is that cgroup kill.
+unit="safehermit-$run_id"
